      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a4e25abae715b48f1d1f30a|full_name}: It's definitely broken and needs a fix. In the map called Apartment 1336, you can enter the Konami cheat code on the Nintendo 64 which would spawn a gun that shot and killed whoever you were aiming at. Now whenever the gun is shot it kills every single person in the instance.",
